# Commit message template for 30 Days of SQL
# 
# Format: Complete Day XX: Topic Name
#
# Examples:
#   Complete Day 1: Setup and SELECT Basics
#   Complete Day 10: Mini Project - Sales Analysis
#   Complete Day 30: Capstone Analytics Database
#
# Other formats:
#   WIP: Day 5 exercises (partial)
#   Fix Day 3 query syntax error
#   Add notes to Day 7 README
#
# Tips:
# - Start with a verb (Complete, Add, Fix, Update)
# - Keep it under 50 characters
# - Be specific and descriptive
